<title>ESTONIA: Estonian Jan CPI 1.4 pct mo/mo, 12.6 pct yr/yr.</title>
<headline>Estonian Jan CPI 1.4 pct mo/mo, 12.6 pct yr/yr.</headline>
<dateline>TALLINN 1997-02-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Inflation in Estonia was 1.4 percent month-on-month in January for a 12.6 percent year-on-year rise, the statistics office said on Monday.</p>
<p> ESTONIAN CONSUMER PRICES     Jan '97   Dec '96    Jan '96</p>
<p> Month-on-month change (pct)  +1.4	+0.7	 +3.5</p>
<p> Year-on-year change (pct)    +12.6     +14.8	+28.8</p>
<p> Index (Dec 1993=100)	   246.1     242.6	218.6%</p>
<p>-- Riga Newsroom + 371 721 5240</p>
</text>
